  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "喝杯帕生特調咖啡，\n讓好心情優雅去飛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "559D676F5E15751F72798ABF54965561FF0C000A8B93597D5FC360C5512A96C553BB98DB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歡迎光臨！\n這裡是專為喜歡連線的人<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n開的咖啡店，「帕生」……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B618FCE514981E8FF01000A901988E1662F5C0870BA559C6B6190237DDA76844EBA00100001BE00000A958B7684549655615E97FF0C300C5E15751F300D2026202600100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好鹹啊～！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D9E79554AFF5EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這咖啡也太鹹了吧！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019549655614E5F592A9E794E865427FF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們帕生特調咖啡的賣點，\n應該是淡淡甜味和香氣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150115E15751F72798ABF5496556176848CE39EDEFF0C000A61C98A72662F6DE16DE1751C5473548C99996C23300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算是天塌下來，\n都不可能有鹹味才是。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97662F5929584C4E0B4F86FF0C000A90FD4E0D53EF80FD67099E795473624D662F300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啣啣～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55635563FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那不是鹽石寶嗎！？\n牠是岩鹽寶可夢，鹽石寶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E0D662F9E7D77F35BF655CEFF01FF1F000A7260662F5CA99E7D5BF653EF5922FF0C9E7D77F35BF6300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位訓練家，拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想調查一下咖啡變鹹這件事，\n是不是和那隻鹽石寶有關。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請幫我捉住牠！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F38ABF67E54E004E0B549655618B8A9E7990194EF64E8BFF0C000A662F4E0D662F548C90A396BB9E7D77F35BF6670995DC300200100001BE00000A8ACB5E6B621163494F4F7260FF0100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請幫我捉來\n剛才那隻鹽石寶！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB5E6B621163494F86000A525B624D90A396BB9E7D77F35BF6FF0100100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好鹹啊～！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D9E79554AFF5EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "委託人希望能捉到的那隻\n鹽石寶就在眼前……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要挑起對戰來捕捉牠嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59D48A174EBA5E0C671B80FD63495230768490A396BB000A9E7D77F35BF65C315728773C524D2026202600100001BE00000A898163118D775C0D62304F8663556349726055CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捕捉牠！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "635563497260FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
