      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "634952309E7D77F35BF64E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳捉到鹽石寶了？\n那麼請回到咖啡店來吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3634952309E7D77F35BF64E86FF1F000A90A39EBC8ACB56DE5230549655615E974F865427300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "剛才提到鹹味太重的這位客人，\n請看這隻寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "525B624D63D052309E795473592A91CD768490194F4D5BA24EBAFF0C000A8ACB770B901996BB5BF653EF5922300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠叫做鹽石寶，\n身體是由岩鹽構成的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n走動時，身上的鹽會被磨得掉下來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "726053EB505A9E7D77F35BF6FF0C000A8EAB9AD4662F75315CA99E7D69CB62107684300200100001BE00000A8D7052D56642FF0C8EAB4E0A76849E7D670388AB78E85F9763894E0B4F86300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會幫您更換這杯\n變鹹的咖啡……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167035E6B60A866F463DB9019676F000A8B8A9E797684549655612026202600100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在那之後，我喝著喝著\n就愛上這個鹹味咖啡了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572890A34E4B5F8CFF0C6211559D8457559D8457000A5C31611B4E0A9019500B9E795473549655614E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "世上也存在著\n加鹽來喝的咖啡對吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E164E0A4E5F5B5857288457000A52A09E7D4F86559D7684549655615C0D542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請務必把它列為\n帕生咖啡店的新品項。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB52D95FC5628A5B83521770BA000A5E15751F549655615E97768465B054C1980530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啥！？\n這……我會考慮看看的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5565FF01FF1F000A901920262026621167038003616E770B770B7684300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "加了鹽石寶的鹽，\n餘韻深厚的鹽石寶咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52A04E869E7D77F35BF676849E7DFF0C000A991897FB6DF1539A76849E7D77F35BF654965561300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我試著研發了，但與其說有鹹味，\n不如說實在是太鹹了……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以還是就當作隱藏品項吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118A6684577814767C4E86FF0C4F46820751768AAA67099E795473FF0C000A4E0D59828AAA5BE65728662F592A9E794E862026202600100001BE00000A62404EE59084662F5C3175764F5C96B185CF54C198055427300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每個人喜歡的口味都不同呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF500B4EBA559C6B61768453E3547390FD4E0D540C5462300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是，幸好有<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這位訓練家\n讓我能找到咖啡變鹹的原因。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662FFF0C5E78597D670900100003110000FF01014F6059B390194F4D8A137DF45BB6000A8B93621180FD627E5230549655618B8A9E797684539F56E0300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
